# Community Shaders TruePBR (Shader Flags 2 bit 23, see build/NIF-CS.xml)

# Skyrim
check BSVersion >= 83
check BSVersion <= 100
check BSLightingShaderProperty
check BSLightingShaderProperty/Shader Flags 2 & 0x800000
checkgroup begin or
	check NiTriBasedGeomData/Has Normals == 1
	check BSTriShape/Vertex Desc & 0x800000000000
checkgroup end

shaders sk_pbr.vert sk_pbr.frag
